{
	"UUID": "1f64533b-1bd0-422c-9050-8310e8939272",
	"Name": "Okta General Overview",
	"Description": "Where to start with Okta data in Gravwell. The top row confirms ingest is healthy on both Okta tags. The middle rows break System Log volume down by the category and subcategory the okta_eventTypes lookup assigns. The bottom rows show where sign-ins are coming from geographically, taken from Okta's own geographical context where present and from the Gravwell Network Enrichment kit where not.\n\nThe risk priority card is a health check on the OKTA_RISK_SCORE macro: if everything lands in one bucket, the thresholds need tuning for your org.",
